  $( Associative law for triple disjunction. $)
  3orass $p |- ( ( ph \/ ps \/ ch ) <-> ( ph \/ ( ps \/ ch ) ) ) $=
    ( w3o wo df-3or orass bitri ) ABCDABECEABCEEABCFABCGH $.
