    $( A simplification of class abstraction.  Theorem 5.2 of [Quine] p. 35. $)
    abid2 $p |- { x | x e. A } = A $=
      ( cv wcel cab biid abbi2i eqcomi ) BACBDZAEIABIFGH $.
