       [TakeutiZaring] p. 30. $)
    dffr2 $p |- ( R Fr A <-> A. x ( ( x (_ A /\ x =/= (/) ) ->
                E. y e. x ( x i^i { z | z R y } ) = (/) ) ) $=
      ( vv vw wfr cv wss c0 wne wa wbr wn wral wrex wi wal cab cin wceq df-fr
      wcel disj visset breq1 elab notbii ralbii bitri rexbii breq2 notbid
      ralbidv cbvrexv imbi2i albii bitr4i ) DEHAIZDJUTKLMZFIZGIZENZOZFUTPZGUTQZ
      RZASVAUTCIZBIZENZCTZUAKUBZBUTQZRZASAGFDEUCVOVHAVNVGVAVNVBVJENZOZFUTPZBUTQ
      VGVMVRBUTVMVBVLUDZOZFUTPVRFUTVLUEVTVQFUTVSVPVKVPCVBFUFVIVBVJEUGUHUIUJUKUL
