       a set i.e. ` A e. V ` (see ~ isset ), then the union of ` A ` is also a
       set.  Same as Axiom 3 of [TakeutiZaring] p. 16. $)
    uniex $p |- U. A e. V $=
      ( vx vy cv cuni cvv wcel wceq unieq eleq1d uniex2 issetri vtocl ) CEZFZGH
      AFZGHCABOAIPQGOAJKDPCDLMN $.
