  $}

  ${
    $d x y A $.  $d x y B $.  $d x y C $.  $d x y D $.
    $( The first member of an ordered pair of classes in a cross product
       belongs to first cross product argument. $)
    opelxp1 $p |- ( <. A , B >. e. ( C X. D ) -> A e. C ) $=
