  $( The first member of an ordered triple of classes in a cross product
     belongs to first cross product argument. $)
  otelxp1 $p |- ( <. <. A , B >. , C >. e. ( ( R X. S ) X. T )
          -> A e. R ) $=
    ( cop cxp wcel opelxp1 syl ) ABGZCGDEHZFHILMIADILCMFJABDEJK $.
