      ( wer ccnv ccom cun wss cv wbr wi wa wal df-er cnvsym cotr anbi12i unss
      19.28v albii 19.26 bitri bitr2i 3bitr3i ) DEDFZDDGZHDIZAJZBJZDKZUJUIDKLZU
