    $( Rearrangement of 4 terms in a sum. $)
    add42i $p |- ( ( A + B ) + ( C + D ) ) = ( ( A + C ) + ( D + B ) ) $=
      ( caddc co add4i addcomi opreq2i eqtri ) ABIJCDIJIJACIJZBDIJZIJODBIJZIJAB
      CDEFGHKPQOIBDFHLMN $.
      $( [22-Aug-1999] $)
