    divval.3 $e |- B =/= 0 $.
    $( Value of division: the (unique) element ` x ` such that
        ` ( B x. x ) = A ` .  This is meaningful only when ` B ` is nonzero. $)
    divvali $p |- ( A / B ) = U. { x e. CC | ( B x. x ) = A } $=
      ( vy vz vw cc wcel cc0 csn cdif cdiv co cv cmul wceq crab cuni wne
