    efcltlem.1 $e |- F = { <. y , z >. | ( y e. NN /\
                    z = ( ( A ^ y ) / ( ! ` y ) ) ) } $.
    ${
      efcltlem1.2 $e |- A e. CC $.
      efcltlem1.3 $e |- A =/= 0 $.
      $( Lemma for ~ efcl .  The series that defines the exponential
         function converges, in the case where its argument is nonzero.  The
         ratio test ~ cvgrati is used to show convergence. $)
      efcltlem1 $p |- E. x ( + seq1 F ) ~~> x $=
        ( vw cabs cfv cfl c1 caddc co cdiv cr wcel clt wbr wa cn cv cle cmul
        wi wral cseq1 cli wex abscli reflcl ax-mp peano2re cc0 absge0i cz wb
