    @( The closure of a subset of a metric space consists of the subset and
       the accumulation points of the subset.  Definition of closure of
       [Kreyszig] p. 21. @)
    clsval2 @p |- ( ( M e. MetSp /\ S (_ X ) -> ( ( cls ` M ) ` S ) =
                 ( S u. { x e. X | x ( acc ` M ) S } ) ) @=
