      w e. NrmCVec ) /\ n = { <. t , y >. | ( t : ( BaseSet ` u ) -->
  ( BaseSet ` w ) /\ y = sup ( { x | E. z e. ( BaseSet ` u ) ( (
  ( norm ` u ) ` z ) <_ 1 /\ x = ( ( norm ` w ) ` ( t ` z ) ) ) } , RR* ,
   < ) ) } ) } $.

    $( Define the class of bounded linear operators between two normed complex
       vector spaces. $)
