           y = U. { z e. H | E. w e. ( _|_ ` H ) x = ( z +h w ) } ) } ) $=
      ( vh vf cv chil wcel cva co wceq cort cfv wrex crab cuni wa copab cch
      cpj cab eleq2 fveq2 rexeq1d anbi12d abbidv df-rab 3eqtr4g unieqd eqeq2d
