    $( ` gcd ( A , B ) ` is the largest natural number that evenly divides both
     ` A ` and ` B ` . $)
    df-gcd $a |- gcd ( A , B ) = sup ( { x e. NN | ( ( A / x ) e. NN
                                           /\ ( B / x ) e. NN ) } , NN , < ) $.

