       the part that are not smaller than the other elements of the part. Read
       ` R mxl A ` as the ` R ` -maximal elements of set ` A ` .  Experimental.
       Don't use. Bourbaki E.R.28 6. $)
    df-mxl $a |- mxl = { <. <. r , x >. , y >. |
       y = { a e. x | A. b e. x -. ( a r b /\ a =/= b ) } } $.
