       whose values are the limits of a function ` a ` . $)
    df-flim2 $a |- fLim2 = { <. <. x , y >. , z >. | ( x e. Top /\ y e. Fil /\
      z = { <. a , b >. | ( a : U. y --> U. x /\
        b = { l | ( ( nei ` x ) ` l ) (_ ( a " y ) } ) } ) } $.
  $}

